00D2E1  1               ;
00D2E1  1               ; THIS ROUTINE IS USED TO ASCERTAIN THAT A GIVEN
00D2E1  1               ; NUMBER OF LOCS REMAIN AVAILABLE FOR THE STACK.
00D2E1  1               ;    THE CALL IS:
