00D2E1  1               ;	JSR	GETSTK
00D2E1  1               ;
00D2E1  1               ; THIS ROUTINE MUST BE CALLED BY ANY ROUTINE WHICH PUTS
00D2E1  1               ; AN ARBITRARY AMOUNT OF STUFF ON THE STACK,
00D2E1  1               ; I.E., ANY RECURSIVE ROUTINE LIKE "FRMEVL".
00D2E1  1               ; IT IS ALSO CALLED BY ROUTINES SUCH AS "GOSUB" AND "FOR"
00D2E1  1               ; WHICH MAKE PERMANENT ENTRIES ON THE STACK.
00D2E1  1               ;
00D2E1  1               ; ROUTINES WHICH MERELY USE AND FREE UP THE GUARANTEED
00D2E1  1               ; NUMLEV LOCATIONS NEED NOT CALL THIS.
