00D49F  1  C9 80        CMP #128 ;NO BUT MAYBE THE END IS HERE.
00D4A1  1  D0 30        BNE NTHIS ;NO, TRULY UNEQUAL.
00D4A3  1  05 0F        ORA COUNT
