00D4EF  1               ;
00D4EF  1               ; FNDLIN SEARCHES THE PROGRAM TEXT FOR THE LINE
00D4EF  1               ; WHOSE NUMBER IS PASSED IN "LINNUM".
00D4EF  1               ; THERE ARE TWO POSSIBLE RETURNS:
00D4EF  1               ;
00D4EF  1               ;	1) CARRY SET.
00D4EF  1               ;	   LOWTR POINTS TO THE LINK FIELD IN THE LINE
00D4EF  1               ;	   WHICH IS THE ONE SEARCHED FOR.
00D4EF  1               ;
00D4EF  1               ;	2) CARRY NOT SET.
00D4EF  1               ;	   LINE NOT FOUND. [LOWTR] POINTS TO THE LINE IN THE
00D4EF  1               ;	   PROGRAM GREATER THAN THE ONE SOUGHT AFTER.
00D4EF  1               ;
00D4EF  1               FNDLIN: ;LOAD [X,A] WITH [TXTTAB]
00D4EF  1  A5 6A        LDA TXTTAB
00D4F1  1  A6 6B        LDX TXTTAB+1
