00D53A  1               ; THIS CODE IS FOR THE CLEAR COMMAND.
00D53A  1               ;
00D53A  1  D0 2A        CLEAR: BNE STKRTS ;SYNTAX ERROR IF NO TERMINATOR.
00D53C  1               ;
00D53C  1               ; CLEAR INITIALIZES THE VARIABLE AND
00D53C  1               ; ARRAY SPACE BY RESETING ARYTAB (THE END OF SIMPLE VARIABLE SPACE)
00D53C  1               ; AND STREND (THE END OF ARRAY STORAGE). IT FALLS INTO "STKINI"
00D53C  1               ; WHICH RESETS THE STACK.
