00D5E9  1  AA           TAX ;MAKE IT A COUNTER.
00D5EA  1  84 88        STY LSTPNT ;SAVE POINTER TO LINE.
00D5EC  1  A0 FF        LDY #255 ;LOOK AT RES'D WORD LIST.
00D5EE  1  CA           RESRCH: DEX ;IS THIS THE RES'D WORD?
