00D670  1               ; PAGE
00D670  1               ; SUBTTL	NEW STATEMENT FETCHER.
00D670  1               ;
00D670  1               ; BACK HERE FOR NEW STATEMENT. CHARACTER POINTED TO BY TXTPTR
00D670  1               ; IS ':' OR END-OF-LINE. THE ADDRESS OF THIS LOC IS LEFT
00D670  1               ; ON THE STACK WHEN A STATEMENT IS EXECUTED SO THAT
00D670  1               ; IT CAN MERELY DO A RTS WHEN IT IS DONE.
00D670  1               ;
00D670  1               NEWSTT:
