00D7F5  1               ;
00D7F5  1               ; "RETURN" RESTORES THE LINE NUMBER AND TEXT PNTR FROM THE STACK
00D7F5  1               ; AND ELIMINATES ALL THE "FOR" ENTRIES IN FRONT OF THE "GOSUB" ENTRY.
