00DB3E  1               ;
00DB3E  1               ; SUBROUTINE TO FIND DATA
00DB3E  1               ; THE SEARCH IS MADE BY USING THE EXECUTION CODE FOR DATA TO
00DB3E  1               ; SKIP OVER STATEMENTS. THE START WORD OF EACH STATEMENT
00DB3E  1               ; IS COMPARED WITH "DATATK". EACH NEW LINE NUMBER
00DB3E  1               ; IS STORED IN "DATLIN" SO THAT IF AN ERROR OCCURS
00DB3E  1               ; WHILE READING DATA THE ERROR MESSAGE CAN GIVE THE LINE
00DB3E  1               ; NUMBER OF THE ILL-FORMATTED DATA.
