00DE87  1               ; SUBTTL	DIMENSION AND VARIABLE SEARCHING.
00DE87  1               ;
00DE87  1               ; THE "DIM" CODE SETS [DIMFLG] AND THEN FALLS INTO THE VARIABLE SEARCH
00DE87  1               ; ROUTINE, WHICH LOOKS AT DIMFLG AT THREE DIFFERENT POINTS.
00DE87  1               ;	1) IF AN ENTRY IS FOUND, "DIMFLG" BEING ON INDICATES
00DE87  1               ;		A "DOUBLY" DIMENSIONED VARIABLE.
00DE87  1               ;	2) WHEN A NEW ENTRY IS BEING BUILT "DIMFLG" BEING ON
00DE87  1               ;		INDICTAES THE INDICES SHOULD BE USED FOR THE
00DE87  1               ;		SIZE OF EACH INDEX. OTHERWISE THE DEFAULT OF TEN
00DE87  1               ;		IS USED.
00DE87  1               ;	3) WHEN THE BUILD ENTRY CODE FINISHES, ONLY IF "DIMFLG" IS OFF
00DE87  1               ;		WILL INDEXING BE DONE.
00DE87  1               ;
00DE87  1  20 72 DD     DIM3: JSR CHKCOM ;MUST BE A COMMA
00DE8A  1  AA           DIM: TAX ;SET [ACCX] NONZERO.
00DE8B  1               ;[ACCA] MUST BE NONZERO TO WORK RIGHT.
00DE8B  1  20 99 DE     DIM1: JSR PTRGT1
00DE8E  1  20 B8 00     DIMCON: JSR CHRGOT ;GET LAST CHARACTER.
