00DE94  1               ; POINTS TO THE TERMINATING CHARCTER.. NOT THAT EVALUATING SUBSCRIPTS
00DE94  1               ; IN A VARIABLE NAME CAN CAUSE RECURSIVE CALLS TO "PTRGET" SO AT
00DE94  1               ; THAT POINT ALL VALUES MUST BE STORED ON THE STACK.
