00E197  1               ; SUBTTL	SIMPLE-USER-DEFINED-FUNCTION CODE.
00E197  1               ;
00E197  1               ; NOTE ONLY SINGLE ARGUMENTS ARE ALLOWED TO FUNCTIONS
00E197  1               ; AND FUNCTIONS MUST BE OF THE SINGLE LINE FORM:
00E197  1               ;	DEF FNA(X)=X^2+X-2
00E197  1               ; NO STRINGS CAN BE INVOLVED WITH THESE FUNCTIONS.
00E197  1               ;
00E197  1               ; IDEA: CREATE A SIMPLE VARIABLE ENTRY
00E197  1               ; WHOSE FIRST CHARACTER HAS THE 200 BIT SET.
00E197  1               ; THE VALUE WILL BE:
