00E197  1               ;
00E197  1               ; FUNCTION NAMES CAN BE LIKE "FNA4".
00E197  1               ;
00E197  1               ;
00E197  1               ; SUBROUTINE TO SEE IF WE ARE IN DIRECT MODE.
00E197  1               ; AND COMPLAIN IF SO.
