00E259  1               ; PAGE
00E259  1               ; SUBTTL	STRING FUNCTIONS.
00E259  1               ;
00E259  1               ; THE STR$ FUNCTION TAKES A NUMBER AND GIVES A STRING
00E259  1               ; WITH THE CHARACTERS THE OUTPUT OF THE NUMBER
00E259  1               ; WOULD HAVE GIVEN.
