00E497  1               ; "FRETMP" IS PASSED A STRING DESCRIPTOR PNTR IN [Y,A].
00E497  1               ; A CHECK IS MADE TO SEE IF THE STRING DESCRIPTOR POINTS TO THE LAST
00E497  1               ; TEMPORARY DESCRIPTOR ALLOCATED BY PUTNEW.
